  - [ADDED] extensions toUInt, toSByte (extensions module)
  - [ADDED] system'collections'BinaryHeap<T1>
  - [ADDED] system'collections'Union<T1,T2>
  - [ADDED] extension ClassHashCode (system'runtime)
  - [FIXED] EventHandle blocked in libc outside a safe region (Linux)
  - [FIXED] EventHandle kept ELENA code inside the safe region, where the collector may move the object under it (Linux)
  - [FIXED] AutoResetEvent released every waiter and lost a signal given before the wait (Linux)
